### Créer un workspace
POST {{api_url}}/api/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "createWorkspaceRequest": {
    "name": "Club Parachutisme Bordeaux",
    "vertical": "GENERIC",
    "active": true,
    "chunkSize": 512,
    "chunkOverlap": 77,
    "prefetchSize": 20,
    "rerank": false,
    "topK": 10
  },
  "createOwnerRequest": {
    "email": "jean@example.com",
    "langue": "fr",
    "firstName": "Jean",
    "lastName": "Dupont"
  }
}

### Lister tous les workspaces
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les workspaces filtrés par nom
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces?name=Martin
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les workspaces filtrés par vertical
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces?vertical=GENERIC
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister les workspaces actifs
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lister avec plusieurs filtres combinés
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces?name=Club&active=true&vertical=GENERIC
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Lire un workspace par ID
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/4c40582f-0f28-49a6-80c5-d7ed05e680a3
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Modifier un workspace
PUT {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/1504a42f-d6d0-4a48-bf79-ccc4958221c2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "updateWorkspaceRequest": {
    "name": "Club Para Bordeaux Renommé",
    "verticalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "active": false,
    "prefetchSize": 20,
    "rerank": false,
    "topK": 10
  },
  "updateOwnerRequest": {
    "email": "marie@example.com",
    "langue": "fr",
    "firstName": "Marie",
    "lastName": "Martin"
  }
}

### Supprimer un workspace
DELETE {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/4c40582f-0f28-49a6-80c5-d7ed05e680a3
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
